  "review": "Exact CPU-only static build; only libSystem/libc++ shared libraries. Direct local model, no router/tools/MCP/projector/UI/remote fetch. LLAMA_SUBPROCESS=OFF compiles dummy subprocess wrapper. ggml.c diagnostic fork is skipped by explicit GGML_NO_BACKTRACE=1; otherwise macOS uses native stacktrace when GGML_BACKTRACE_LLDB is absent. Cleared explicit environment excludes that opt-in. Reviewed runtime CPU source has no other fork/spawn/setsid/setpgid paths. Native policy is trusted bounded operator review, not attestation; hostile same-user replacement/system libraries are outside trust boundary.",
